 plan=read(A/'plan.json');ready=read(A/'submission_ready.json');audit=read(A/'independent_validation.json');assert audit['passed'] and ready['sha256']==audit['submission_sha256'];lines=['# V90 diagnostic submission ready','','**An upload-ready experimental file is available. Superiority over V66 is not established.** This is a post hoc leaderboard diagnostic using the unchanged, previously unsubmitted V86 interval25 configuration. V88 and V89 failed their original criteria and remain recorded as failures.','','## File','','`experiments/v90_interval_diagnostic/prediction.vcc`','',f"- Bytes: {ready['bytes']:,}.",'- SHA256: `'+ready['sha256']+'`.','- Cells: 360,000; genes: 18,533; contexts: 3; targets/context: 300; cells/target: 400.','- Official prep passed; the complete packaged sparse payload was compared independently.','- Every original selected template/library was verified; 12 full groups regenerate exactly.','- Uploaded: false; hidden score: unknown.','','## Measured public tradeoffs','','655 reused target/context pairs: desired-profile error ratio 0.996265839 relative to V66, raw PDS change -0.000536222. This is not an anchored Overall estimate. Strong shared/shuffled superiority criteria failed.','','| Seed | Profile error reduction | PDS change | Fidelity change | Reach change | Jaccard change | NMAE change |','|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|']
